---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear()
---

<footer class="border-t border-line bg-bg-2 mt-auto" role="contentinfo">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Base44 Expert" width="180" height="32" class="h-8 w-auto mb-4" />
        <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          Independent specialist studio that unsticks stuck Base44 apps - publish, domains, schema, production.
          Not affiliated with Base44 or Wix. We do not greenfield-build apps.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink mb-4">Studio</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/work" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">Process</a></li>
          <li><a href="/start" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">Start a diagnostic</a></li>
          <li><a href="/updates" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">Updates</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink mb-4">Problem paths</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/base44-not-working" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">Base44 not working</a></li>
          <li><a href="/custom-domains" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">Custom domains and SSL</a></li>
          <li><a href="/base44-expert" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors">Why this studio</a></li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://fixthebase.com" class="text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
              FixTheBase
              <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
              </svg>
              <span class="sr-only">(opens in new tab)</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pad-inset-md border-t border-line flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">&copy; {currentYear} Base44 Expert. Independent studio.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted">Built by Naor Yanko</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
